{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link., LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
    
    SETTINGS
    Global: accent colour; display font (font_picker, default oswald_n7); overlay opacity (range 0–80, default 25); autoplay (checkbox, on); autoplay seconds (range 3–12, default 6); pause on hover (checkbox, on).
    Slides: 6 fixed groups with a header for each ("Slide 1" to "Slide 6"). Each group has: image (image_picker), location (text), title line 1 (text), title line 2 (text), description (textarea), button label (text, default "Discover location"), button link (url). Skip any slide without a title, so the block works with 2 to 6 slides. If a slide has no image, use a Shopify placeholder SVG on dark grey., DEMO CONTENT (defaults)
    1. Switzerland Alps — SAINT / ANTÖNIEN
    2. Japan Alps — NAGANO / PREFECTURE
    3. Sahara Desert - Morocco — MARRAKECH / MERZOUGA
    4. Sierra Nevada - United States — YOSEMITE / NATIONAL PARK
    5. Tarifa - Spain — LOS LANCES / BEACH
    6. Cappadocia - Turkey — GÖREME / VALLEY
    Use this description on all six: "Mauris malesuada nisi sit amet augue accumsan tincidunt. Maecenas tincidunt, velit ac porttitor pulvinar, tortor eros facilisis libero."
    
    RESPONSIVE
    - ≤1024px: cards clamp(150px, 18vw, 190px); the track starts at left 46%.
    - ≤749px: content top at 18%; title clamp(40px, 11vw, 56px); description max-width 90%. The card track moves under the content (left 5vw, bottom 120px), cards are 132px wide with a 12px gap, and the row scrolls horizontally with scroll-snap. The controls row sits at bottom 32px with 5vw side padding; arrows are 48px and the counter is 32px.
    
    IMAGES
    Each slide has one image, used for both its background and its card. Use image_url + image_tag with srcset (backgrounds up to 2400w, cards up to 600w). Load slide 1's background eagerly with fetchpriority="high". Lazy-load everything else.
    
    Render slide 1 as active. Prev, next and card clicks only need to swap content for now. , STATE
    - Track a single activeIndex and loop infinitely.
    - "Next" makes the first card the active slide. Clicking any card makes that card's slide active, and the expansion starts from that card's position.
    - Ignore input while a transition runs (about 1.3s).
    
    NEXT / CARD-CLICK TRANSITION (about 1.2s; easing cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1) unless stated)
    1. 0ms — The clicked card scales to 1.04 over 150ms.
    2. 0–650ms — The card grows into the new background:
       - Place a full-size layer holding the new slide's background image above the old background.
       - Start it with clip-path: inset(...) that matches the card's exact rect, measured with getBoundingClientRect relative to the section, with a 10px radius.
       - Animate the clip-path to inset(0 round 0). The image keeps its final full-screen framing and is revealed through a growing window. It also scales from 1.1 to 1.
       - Hide the real card the moment this starts.
    3. 0–650ms — The old scene darkens: the old background goes to filter: brightness(.25), and the old left text fades to 20% opacity in place without moving. A dark frame stays visible around the growing image.
    4. 650ms — The new image becomes the real background and the layer is removed. Swap in the new slide's text, hidden and ready to reveal.
    5. 60–750ms — The cards shift left by one slot, each lagging 80ms behind the card before it. The gaps briefly widen, then close up; this elastic-gap look is important. Each card moves for 600ms with cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1). The slide that just left the background is added as the last card: it fades in from translateX(40px), opacity 0 → 1, over 400ms, after the others settle.
    6. From 550ms — Text reveal: each element starts 90ms after the previous one and runs 600ms with cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1):
       - dash: scaleX 0 → 1, transform-origin left
       - eyebrow: translateY(105%) → 0 inside its mask
       - title line 1, then title line 2: translateY(105%) → 0 inside their masks, so the letters rise up from a hidden baseline
       - description: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
       - button row: translateY(14px) → 0, opacity 0 → 1
    7. From 300ms — The counter rolls up: the old number goes from translateY(0) to -100% while the new one comes up from 100% to 0, both over 450ms.
    8. From 300ms — The progress line's accent fill animates to activeIndex ÷ total over 600ms., PREV TRANSITION (mirror of Next)
    - The current background shrinks back into a card at the first card slot: clip-path goes from inset(0) to that slot's rect over 650ms. The previous slide's image sits underneath and brightens from .25 to 1.
    - The cards shift right by one slot with the same 80ms lag between cards. The last card fades out to the right.
    - Use the same text reveal. The counter rolls downward instead.
    
    AUTOPLAY + TOP BAR
    - When autoplay is on, the 3px top bar grows linearly from 0 to 100% over "autoplay seconds". At 100%, trigger Next. Reset the bar to 0 instantly and restart it once the transition ends.
    - Pause when the slider is hovered (if that setting is on), when the tab is hidden (visibilitychange), and when the section is off-screen (IntersectionObserver). While paused, the bar freezes and later resumes from where it stopped. Drive it with requestAnimationFrame and elapsed time.
    - Any manual navigation resets the bar.
    
    INPUT
    - Prev and next buttons, card clicks, the ←/→ keys when the slider is focused, and a horizontal swipe on the background (50px threshold).
    - ≤749px: after each change, smooth-scroll the card row back to the start.
    
    FIRST LOAD
    The background fades in while scaling from 1.08 to 1 over 1.2s. Then the text reveal runs once, and the cards fade up from translateY(30px), each 80ms after the previous one., QUALITY
    - Animate only transform, opacity, clip-path and filter. Apply will-change only while a transition is running.
    - prefers-reduced-motion: replace every effect with a 300ms crossfade, and keep the top bar static.
    - After each change, preload the next slide's background image.
    - Accessibility: give the wrapper role="region" and aria-roledescription="carousel". Give the arrows aria-labels. Label each card "Go to {title}". Add an aria-live="polite" region that announces "Slide 2 of 6: Nagano Prefecture".
    - Theme editor: re-initialise on shopify:section:load, clear timers and observers on shopify:section:unload, and turn autoplay off when Shopify.designMode is true.
    - Wrap all JS in an IIFE scoped to this block's id. Use no globals.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign uid = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
#dest-{{ uid }}{display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:100svh;min-height:640px;overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff;font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;isolation:isolate}#dest-{{ uid }} .bg{position:absolute;inset:0}#dest-{{ uid }} .bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(1);transform:scale(1.08);opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.2s,transform 1.2s}#dest-{{ uid }}.ready .bg img{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}#dest-{{ uid }} .shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient({{ block.settings.overlay_opacity }}%,rgba(0,0,0,.4) 0%,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,.35),transparent 20%);pointer-events:none}#dest-{{ uid }} .bar{position:absolute;z-index:6;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;background:transparent}#dest-{{ uid }} .bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:{{ block.settings.accent }};transform-origin:left}#dest-{{ uid }} .content{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:5vw;top:35%;max-width:42vw}#dest-{{ uid }} .dash{width:20px;height:3px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:18px}#dest-{{ uid }} .eyebrow{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}#dest-{{ uid }} h1{font-family:{{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px);line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0}#dest-{{ uid }} .titleline{display:block;overflow:hidden}#dest-{{ uid }} .titleline span{display:block}#dest-{{ uid }} .desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;opacity:.75;max-width:390px;margin:18px 0 28px}#dest-{{ uid }} .actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}#dest-{{ uid }} .discover{height:40px;padding:0 28px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:999px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-transform:uppercase}#dest-{{ uid }} .discover:hover{background:white;color:#111}#dest-{{ uid }} .track{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;top:42%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw;overflow:visible}#dest-{{ uid }} .card{position:relative;flex:none;width:clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#333;color:#fff;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 22px 40px #0006;transition:transform .3s,opacity .4s;will-change:auto}#dest-{{ uid }} .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}#dest-{{ uid }} .card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#dest-{{ uid }} .card:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:40% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.65))}#dest-{{ uid }} .ct{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:20px;left:16px;padding-right:8px}#dest-{{ uid }} .ct b{display:block;width:12px;height:2px;background:white;margin-bottom:10px}#dest-{{ uid }} .ct small{font-size:12px;opacity:.85}#dest-{{ uid }} .ct strong{display:block;font:700 21px/1.05 {{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}#dest-{{ uid }} .controls{position:absolute;z-index:4;left:41%;right:4vw;top:91%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;transform:translateY(-50%)}#dest-{{ uid }} .arrow{width:60px;height:60px;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;flex:none}#dest-{{ uid }} .arrow:hover{background:#ffffff1a;border-color:white}#dest-{{ uid }} .arrow svg{width:20px;height:20px}#dest-{{ uid }} .progress{height:1px;flex:1;background:#ffffff59;margin:0 12px;position:relative}#dest-{{ uid }} .progress i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:0;background:{{ block.settings.accent }};height:2px}#dest-{{ uid }} .count{font:700 clamp(36px,3.6vw,56px)/1 {{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;min-width:2ch;overflow:hidden}#dest-{{ uid }} .live{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}#dest-{{ uid }} .transition-layer{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:5;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(0);will-change:clip-path,transform,opacity}#dest-{{ uid }} .transition-layer img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform:scale(1.1);will-change:transform}#dest-{{ uid }}.moving .bg img,#dest-{{ uid }}.moving .content,#dest-{{ uid }}.moving .card,#dest-{{ uid }}.moving .transition-layer{will-change:transform,opacity,clip-path,filter}#dest-{{ uid }} .content.reveal .dash{animation:dash-{{ uid }} .6s both}#dest-{{ uid }} .content.reveal .eyebrow span,#dest-{{ uid }} .content.reveal .titleline span{animation:rise-{{ uid }} .6s both}#dest-{{ uid }} .content.reveal .desc,#dest-{{ uid }} .content.reveal .actions{animation:fadeup-{{ uid }} .6s both}@keyframes dash-{{ uid }}{from{transform:scaleX(0)}to{transform:scaleX(1)}}@keyframes rise-{{ uid }}{from{transform:translateY(105%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}@keyframes fadeup-{{ uid }}{from{transform:translateY(14px);opacity:0}to{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}}@media(max-width:1024px){#dest-{{ uid }} .track{left:46%}#dest-{{ uid }} .card{width:clamp(150px,18vw,190px)}}@media(max-width:749px){#dest-{{ uid }} .content{top:18%;left:5vw;max-width:90vw}#dest-{{ uid }} h1{font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,56px)}#dest-{{ uid }} .desc{max-width:90%}#dest-{{ uid }} .track{left:5vw;right:0;top:auto;bottom:120px;overflow-x:auto;gap:12px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}#dest-{{ uid }} .card{width:132px;scroll-snap-align:start}#dest-{{ uid }} .controls{left:5vw;right:5vw;top:auto;bottom:32px;transform:none}#dest-{{ uid }} .arrow{width:48px;height:48px}#dest-{{ uid }} .count{font-size:32px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#dest-{{ uid }} .bg img{transition:opacity .3s;transform:none!important}#dest-{{ uid }} .bar i{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}#dest-{{ uid }} .card,#dest-{{ uid }} .content *{animation:none!important;transition:opacity .3s!important}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-slider-{{ uid }} id="dest-{{ uid }}" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Destination highlights" data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}" data-seconds="{{ block.settings.autoplay_seconds }}" data-pause="{{ block.settings.pause_hover }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="bg"><img class="background-image" src="" alt="" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="shade"></div><div class="bar"><i></i></div>
<div class="content"><div class="dash"></div><div class="eyebrow"><span></span></div><h1><span class="titleline"><span></span></span><span class="titleline"><span></span></span></h1><p class="desc"></p><div class="actions"><a class="discover" href="#">Discover location</a></div></div><div class="track"></div>
<div class="controls"><button class="arrow prev" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><button class="arrow next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button><div class="progress"><i></i></div><div class="count">01</div></div><div class="live" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
<script type="application/json" class="slide-data">[{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign ik = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image'
assign lk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location'
assign a = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_one'
assign b = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_two'
assign dk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_description'
assign uk = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_link'
assign pic = block.settings[ik]
%}{% if forloop.first == false %},{% endif %}{"location":{{ block.settings[lk] | json }},"one":{{ block.settings[a] | json }},"two":{{ block.settings[b] | json }},"description":{{ block.settings[dk] | json }},"link":{{ block.settings[uk] | json }},"image":{% if pic %}{{ pic | image_url: width: 2400 | json }}{% else %}""{% endif %}}{% endfor %}]</script>
<script>(function(){const tag='destination-slider-{{ uid }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class Slider extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.init()}disconnectedCallback(){this.cleanup()}init(){if(this.ready)return;this.ready=true;this.items=JSON.parse(this.querySelector('.slide-data').textContent).filter(s=>s.one||s.two);this.items.forEach((s,i)=>s.index=i);this.root=this;this.bg=this.querySelector('.background-image');this.content=this.querySelector('.content');this.track=this.querySelector('.track');this.bar=this.querySelector('.bar i');this.progress=this.querySelector('.progress i');this.live=this.querySelector('.live');this.active=0;this.busy=false;this.elapsed=0;this.last=0;this.visible=true;this.hidden=document.hidden;this.hover=false;this.editor=!!(window.Shopify&&Shopify.designMode);this.autoplay=this.dataset.autoplay==='true'&&!this.editor;this.seconds=Number(this.dataset.seconds)*1000;this.reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;this.render(true);this.track.addEventListener('click',e=>{const c=e.target.closest('[data-index]');if(c)this.go(Number(c.dataset.index),c)});this.querySelector('.next').addEventListener('click',()=>this.go((this.active+1)%this.items.length));this.querySelector('.prev').addEventListener('click',()=>this.go((this.active-1+this.items.length)%this.items.length));this.key=e=>{if(e.key==='ArrowRight'){e.preventDefault();this.go((this.active+1)%this.items.length)}if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'){e.preventDefault();this.go((this.active-1+this.items.length)%this.items.length)}};this.addEventListener('keydown',this.key);this.mouseenter=()=>{this.hover=true};this.mouseleave=()=>{this.hover=false};this.addEventListener('mouseenter',this.mouseenter);this.addEventListener('mouseleave',this.mouseleave);this.vis=()=>{this.hidden=document.hidden};document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',this.vis);this.observer=new IntersectionObserver(es=>{this.visible=es[0].isIntersecting});this.observer.observe(this);this.touchX=0;this.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{this.touchX=e.changedTouches[0].clientX},{passive:true});this.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{const dx=e.changedTouches[0].clientX-this.touchX;if(Math.abs(dx)>50)this.go((this.active+(dx<0?1:-1)+this.items.length)%this.items.length)},{passive:true});this.sectionLoad=()=>{if(!this.isConnected)this.init()};this.sectionUnload=e=>{if(e.target.contains(this))this.cleanup()};document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load',this.sectionLoad);document.addEventListener('shopify:section:unload',this.sectionUnload);this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(t=>this.tick(t));if(!this.reduce)this.content.classList.add('reveal');this.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach((c,i)=>{c.style.animationDelay=(i*.08)+'s';c.style.opacity='1';c.style.transform='translateY(0)'})}render(first){const s=this.items[this.active];this.bg.src=s.image||'';this.bg.alt=[s.location,s.one,s.two].filter(Boolean).join(' ');this.content.querySelector('.eyebrow span').textContent=s.location;this.content.querySelectorAll('.titleline span')[0].textContent=s.one;this.content.querySelectorAll('.titleline span')[1].textContent=s.two;this.content.querySelector('.desc').textContent=s.description;const link=this.content.querySelector('.discover');link.href=s.link||'#';this.track.replaceChildren();for(let n=1;n<this.items.length;n++){const ix=(this.active+n)%this.items.length,it=this.items[ix],btn=document.createElement('button');btn.className='card';btn.dataset.index=ix;btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Go to '+[it.one,it.two].filter(Boolean).join(' '));if(it.image){const im=document.createElement('img');im.src=it.image.replace(/width=\d+/,'width=600');im.alt='';im.loading='lazy';btn.append(im)}const tx=document.createElement('span');tx.className='ct';tx.innerHTML='<b></b><small></small><strong></strong>';tx.querySelector('small').textContent=it.location;tx.querySelector('strong').textContent=[it.one,it.two].filter(Boolean).join(' ');btn.append(tx);this.track.append(btn)}this.querySelector('.count').textContent=String(this.active+1).padStart(2,'0');this.progress.style.width=(this.active/this.items.length*100)+'%';this.live.textContent='Slide '+(this.active+1)+' of '+this.items.length+': '+[s.one,s.two].filter(Boolean).join(' ');if(!first)this.preload()}preload(){const s=this.items[(this.active+1)%this.items.length];if(s&&s.image){const im=new Image();im.src=s.image}}go(index,card){if(this.busy||!this.items.length||index===this.active)return;this.busy=true;this.elapsed=0;const old=this.active;this.active=index;const s=this.items[index],rect=card?card.getBoundingClientRect():this.track.querySelector('.card')?.getBoundingClientRect();this.classList.add('moving');if(this.reduce){this.bg.style.opacity='0';setTimeout(()=>{this.render(false);this.bg.style.opacity='1';this.finish()},300);return}const layer=document.createElement('div');layer.className='transition-layer';const im=document.createElement('img');im.src=s.image||'';layer.append(im);this.append(layer);if(rect){const r=this.getBoundingClientRect();const top=rect.top-r.top,left=rect.left-r.left;layer.style.clipPath=`inset(${top}px ${r.width-left-rect.width}px ${r.height-top-rect.height}px ${left}px round 10px)`}if(card)card.style.opacity='0';this.bg.style.filter='brightness(.25)';this.content.style.opacity='.2';requestAnimationFrame(()=>{layer.style.transition='clip-path 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1)';layer.style.clipPath='inset(0 round 0)';im.style.transition='transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1)';im.style.transform='scale(1)'});setTimeout(()=>{this.render(false);layer.remove();this.bg.style.filter='brightness(1)';this.content.style.opacity='1';this.content.classList.remove('reveal');void this.content.offsetWidth;this.content.classList.add('reveal');this.finish()},650)}finish(){this.classList.remove('moving');this.busy=false;this.elapsed=0;if(innerWidth<750)this.track.scrollTo({left:0,behavior:'smooth'})}tick(t){if(this.last&&this.autoplay&&!this.busy&&!this.reduce&&this.visible&&!this.hidden&&(!thi